<div id="c23021" class="evencomment">
<b><a target="_blank" title="http://www.theroadislife.com" href="http://www.theroadislife.com/cgi-bin/mt/mcom.cgi?__mode=red;id=23021">Ryan</a> </b> said:<br>
<br>
<p>My intention was not to offend, however those pigs were going to market whether or not I posted the photo.  Perhaps it would be a worse crime to let it go undocumented. </p>

<p>Animal welfare, environmental welfare, and very often human welfare, is horrific in many of the poor countries of the world.   Come see it first hand, then do something.</p>

